    "content": "<p><b>Shiproom Hygiene Summary - 2026-08-27</b></p>\n<p style='color:gray;font-size:12px;'>Agent: Poster | Job: mPoster-hygiene-teams-summary | Start: 2026-08-27 08:57:52 PDT | Complete: 2026-08-27 08:57:52 PDT</p>\n\n\n\n\n<p><b>Tasks Missing Estimates or Parent (1)</b></p><p>Current sprint tasks missing Original Estimate, Remaining Work, or parent link:</p><table border='1' style='border-collapse:collapse;width:100%;'><tr><th>Task</th><th>Title</th><th>Owner</th><th>Issue</th></tr><tr><td><a href=\"https://domoreexp.visualstudio.com/MSTeams/_workitems/edit/5673310\">5673310</a></td><td>Joined a Meet Now (from group chat) while in a meeting. Meeting put on hold and I joined the Meet Now but I have no stage for the Meet Now. There is no way to exit.</td><td><at id=\"0\">Paresh Mewada</at></td><td>RemainingWork, parent link</td></tr></table>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<p><b>Proposed Bugs &gt; 24 Hours (2)</b></p><p>These bugs have been in Proposed state for more than 24 hours and need triage (Active or Closed):</p><table border='1' style='border-collapse:collapse;width:100%;'><tr><th>Bug</th><th>Title</th><th>Owner</th><th>Last Changed</th></tr><tr><td><a href=\"https://domoreexp.visualstudio.com/MSTeams/_workitems/edit/5734026\">5734026</a></td><td>[Flight Blocker] [FF]Aug known bots 2</td><td><at id=\"1\">Varun Venkatesh</at></td><td>2026-08-25</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"https://domoreexp.visualstudio.com/MSTeams/_workitems/edit/5741090\">5741090</a></td><td>Deeplink meeting join: deeplink_into_meeting hangs at fire-calling-intent handoff and times out (120s) before the join scenario starts</td><td><at id=\"2\">Juan Zepeda Salvatierra</at></td><td>2026-08-25</td></tr></table>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<p><b>Missing Sign-Offs (8)</b></p><p>Active Features missing required governance sign-offs:</p><table border='1' style='border-collapse:collapse;width:100%;'><tr><th>Feature</th><th>Title</th><th>Owner</th><th>Missing</th></tr><tr><td><a href=\"https://domoreexp.v